  "description": "The target community is individuals who identify with or admire modern, confident Muslim women who express their identity through contemporary fashion, including the hijab as a stylish accessory. This includes Muslim women, fashion-conscious individuals interested in inclusive and diverse style, and supporters of cultural representation in mainstream fashion. The meme appeals to those who value self-expression, empowerment, and the subversion of stereotypes about hijab-wearing women being outdated or unfashionable.",
